          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 364,
            "text": "theorem jetProduct_bound {ε F G : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (hF : 0 ≤ F) (hG : 0 ≤ G)\n    (f g : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ)\n    (hf : ∀ n m, |f n m| ≤ F * weight ε n m)\n    (hg : ∀ n m, |g n m| ≤ G * weight ε n m) (n m : ℕ) :\n    |jetProduct f g n m| ≤ 64 * F * G * weight ε n m"
          }
        }
